#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Saitin SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Izinin na'urorin ku bai shafi kowace na'ura ba, don haka ba za ku iya fitarwa ko shigar da saitin SmokePing ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa mai damar shiga dukkan na'urori."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Fitar da Saitin SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Fitarwar tana ƙunshe da saitunan ƙarin manhaja, makasudan SmokePing da ƙarin manhajar ya karanta, da wace na'ura aka haɗa kowanne da ita, ta sunan uwar garke da bayanin na'urar. Ba ta ƙunshe da tushen bayanai, jadawali, fayil ɗin RRD, ko bayanan sirri ba."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Sauke"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Shigar da Saitin SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Zaɓar fayil yana duba shi ne kawai. Allon na gaba zai jero kowane sauyi da fayil ɗin zai yi, kuma ba za a rubuta komai ba har sai kun tabbatar da wannan jeri. Shigarwa tana ƙarawa da sabuntawa; ba ta taɓa share makasudi ko matsar da haɗi ba, kuma ba ta taɓa ƙirƙirar fayil ɗin RRD ko taɓa kundin bayanan SmokePing ba."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Duba Fayil"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Duba Shigarwa"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ba a rubuta komai ba."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Koma"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ba za a iya shigar da fayil ɗin ba har sai an gyara waɗannan kurakurai. Ba a rubuta komai ba."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Shigarwar da ke akwai ta riga ta yi daidai da fayil ɗin. Babu abin da za a shigar."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Tsari %s. Aiwatarwa za ta yi waɗannan sauye-sauyen daidai a cikin aiki guda. Idan fayil ɗin ko shigarwar sun sauya tun bayan wannan dubawa, za a ƙi shigarwar kuma ku sake dubawa."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Aiwatar da Shigarwa"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Soke"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Ƙara Makasudan SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "babu makasudin SmokePing da ya dace"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Danna Ci gaba don ƙara makasudan SmokePing waɗanda uwar garkensu ita ce sunan uwar garken kowace na'ura da aka zaɓa. Kowane makasudi yana samun jadawalin taƙaitawa don faɗakarwa kuma, idan ana iya zana bayanan SmokePing, jadawalin hayaki. Ba a taɓa ƙirƙirar na'urori a nan ba."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Makasudai %d sun dace."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "An ƙirƙiri ko haɗa abubuwa %d, an tsallake %d."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Wannan na'ura tana da makasudan SmokePing, amma mai karatu da ke cika ƙimar taƙaitawarsu yana aiki a kan mai bincike %d kuma an adana na'urar a kan mai bincike %d. Ƙimar taƙaitawa da faɗakarwa za su tsaya har sai an sake sanya na'urar ga mai bincike %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Makasudan SmokePing na wannan Na'ura"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Jadawalan hayaki %d har yanzu suna zana sauran launuka; babban mai bincike yana matsar da har zuwa 200 a kowane zagaye."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Ba a iya matsar da jadawalan hayaki %d ba; gudanar da upgrade-graphs don sake gwada su, kuma duba rajistar Cacti don dalilin."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Saitin Launukan Asara yana neman launukan asara na SmokePing %s, amma mai karatu ya gano SmokePing %s. Saita shi zuwa Na atomatik sai dai idan jadawalan su bambanta da na SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Saitin Launukan Asara yana zaɓar launukan asara na SmokePing %s don jadawalan hayaki."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Mai karatu bai gano sigar SmokePing ba, don haka saitin Launukan Asara yana zaɓar launukan asara na SmokePing 2.8 da na gaba. Idan SmokePing 2.7 ne, saita Launukan Asara zuwa SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Mai karatu ya gano SmokePing %s, don haka saitin Launukan Asara yana zaɓar launukan asararsa."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da Thold ba, don haka babu makasudi da ke faɗakarwa a cikin SmokePing da Thold duka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Babu makasudi da ke da faɗakarwar SmokePing da kuma iyakar Thold da aka kunna."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Makasudai %d suna da faɗakarwar SmokePing da iyakar Thold da aka kunna duka, don haka matsala ɗaya za ta iya sanar sau biyu. Kwatanta sharuɗɗan faɗakarwarsu kafin cire ɗaya: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Samfuran SmokePing sun gaza shiga kuma ba a sake gwadawa ta atomatik ba: %s Yi amfani da Sake Gwada Shigar da Samfuri bayan gyara dalilin."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da samfuran SmokePing ba. Yi amfani da Sake Gwada Shigar da Samfuri."

