#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Ana karanta fayil ɗin SmokePing da aka saita tare da fayilolin da ya haɗa, daga kundinsa na kansa. Ana karanta fayil ɗin da aka ɗora shi kaɗai: ba a yarda da @include a cikinsa ba."

