#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Madubin tsarin SmokePing zuwa cikin bishiyar jadawali: kowane sashe zai zama reshe, kuma kowace na'ura uwar garke a ƙarƙashin reshen makasudanta. Ana sake amfani da rassan da uwargarkunan da ke akwai."

