#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "Tushen SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Poller na SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Poller na Cacti da ke aiki a kan, ko ke raba tsarin fayiloli tare da, na'urar SmokePing. Wannan poller kaɗai ne ke karanta bayanan SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Saitin SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Babban fayil ɗin saitin SmokePing, wanda poller da ke gudanar da mai karatu ke karantawa. Plugin ɗin yana karanta shi da fayilolin da ya ƙunsa ta hanyar amfani da nasa mai fassara kuma ba ya taɓa rubutu a cikinsu. Fayilolin da aka haɗa dole su kasance a cikin kundin adireshin wannan fayil."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Kundin Adireshin Bayanai na SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Kundin adireshin datadir daga saitin SmokePing, kamar yadda SmokePing ke ganin sa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Haɗin Mount na Cacti na Kundin Adireshin Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Haɗin bind ko NFS mount na karatu-kaɗai na kundin adireshin bayanai na SmokePing a cikin hanyar RRA ta Cacti. Cacti yana karanta fayilolin RRD ne kawai a cikin hanyarsa ta RRA kuma ba ya taɓa karantawa ta hanyar symlink."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Mai Karatu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Kasafin Lokacin Mai Karatu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da gudanarwar mai karatu guda ɗaya za ta iya ɗauka tana karanta fayilolin RRD kafin ta tsaya ta ci gaba a zagayen poller na gaba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Ƙididdiga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Mafi ƙarancin daƙiƙoƙi tsakanin gudanarwar ƙididdiga. Ƙididdigar tana kuma gudana lokacin da fayil ɗin saiti ya sauya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Izinin Sabuntawa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙi bayan mataki guda ɗaya da a cikinsu ake ci gaba da ɗaukar awo a matsayin na yanzu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Launukan Asara"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Waɗanne launukan asara na SmokePing ne jadawalan smoke ke zanawa. SmokePing 2.7 yana zana wasu matakan asara daban da na 2.8 da na gaba. Na atomatik yana bin sigar SmokePing da mai karatu ya samu kusa da SmokePing, wanda aka nuna a shafin lafiya, kuma yana amfani da 2.8 da na gaba idan bai samu ko ɗaya ba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Na atomatik"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.8 da na gaba"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Idan an yi masa alama, cire plugin ɗin zai adana teburansa na ƙididdiga, taswira, da lafiya. Ba a taɓa cire fayilolin SmokePing ko ta yaya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Kundin Adireshin Ajiya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Inda cire plugin ɗin ke rubuta fitar da bayanan saitin plugin ɗin. Bar shi fanko don amfani da kundin adireshin cache/smokeping na Cacti, wanda plugin ɗin ke karewa da ƙa'idar hana-kowa. Kundin adireshin da aka saita a nan dole ya kasance ya riga ya wanzu, ana iya rubutu a cikinsa, kuma ya kasance a wajen tushen yanar gizo; idan ba za a iya rubutu a cikinsa ba ba za a rubuta fitar da bayanai ba."

